#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:2
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:4
msgid ""
"Install q2m3 from source with Python 3.11 or newer and ``uv``. Run the H2 examples before larger "
"SQD or Catalyst calculations."
msgstr "使用 Python 3.11 或更新版本及 ``uv`` 从源码安装 q2m3。运行较大的 SQD 或 Catalyst 计算前，先运行 H2 示例。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:8
msgid "Install"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:16
msgid ""
"``uv run`` uses the project's ``.venv``. Activation is optional. The core dependencies include "
"PySCF, PennyLane, NumPy, SciPy, Matplotlib, and Rich."
msgstr "``uv run`` 使用项目的 ``.venv``，无需手动激活。核心依赖包括 PySCF、PennyLane、NumPy、SciPy、Matplotlib 和 Rich。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:19
msgid "Add extras for the workflow you need:"
msgstr "按工作流添加 extras："

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:24 ../../source/getting-started.rst:64
msgid "Workflow"
msgstr "工作流"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:25
msgid "Command"
msgstr "命令"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:26
msgid "Development"
msgstr "开发"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:27
msgid "``uv sync --frozen --extra dev``"
msgstr "``uv sync --frozen --extra dev``"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:28
msgid "SQD"
msgstr "SQD"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:29
msgid "``uv sync --frozen --extra sqd``"
msgstr "``uv sync --frozen --extra sqd``"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:30
msgid "Catalyst solvation"
msgstr "Catalyst 溶剂化"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:31
msgid "``uv sync --frozen --extra catalyst --extra solvation``"
msgstr "``uv sync --frozen --extra catalyst --extra solvation``"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:32
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "文档"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:33
msgid "``uv sync --frozen --extra docs --extra sqd --extra catalyst --extra solvation --extra viz``"
msgstr "``uv sync --frozen --extra docs --extra sqd --extra catalyst --extra solvation --extra viz``"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:35
msgid ""
"The ``gpu`` extra requires compatible NVIDIA drivers and CUDA runtime support. CPU examples do "
"not require it."
msgstr "``gpu`` extra 要求兼容的 NVIDIA 驱动和 CUDA 运行时。CPU 示例无需该 extra。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:39
msgid "Run H2 validation"
msgstr "运行 H2 检查"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:46
msgid ""
"The first script compares vacuum and MM-embedded HF and QPE energies. Inspect every ``[OK]`` and "
"``[FAIL]`` line. Its exit status does not report failed checks. The second script estimates "
"quantum hardware resources. See :doc:`tutorials/h2-qpe-validation` and :doc:`tutorials/h2"
"-resource-estimation` for interpretation."
msgstr ""
"第一个脚本对比真空与 MM 嵌入体系的 HF 和 QPE 能量。检查每一行 ``[OK]`` 和 ``[FAIL]``。其退出状态不反映检查失败。第二个脚本估算量子硬件资源。结果解释见 "
":doc:`tutorials/h2-qpe-validation` 和 :doc:`tutorials/h2-resource-estimation`。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:51
msgid "Energies use Hartree internally. Convert explicitly before reporting kcal/mol:"
msgstr "内部能量单位为 Hartree。报告 kcal/mol 前须显式转换："

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:59
msgid "Choose the next workflow"
msgstr "选择后续工作流"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:65
msgid "Requirements and scope"
msgstr "要求与范围"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:66
msgid ":doc:`tutorials/h2-mc-solvation`"
msgstr ":doc:`tutorials/h2-mc-solvation`"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:67
msgid "Catalyst and solvation extras. 8 GB+ RAM recommended."
msgstr "需要 catalyst 和 solvation extras。建议至少 8 GB 内存。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:68
msgid ":doc:`tutorials/sqd-showcase`"
msgstr ":doc:`tutorials/sqd-showcase`"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:69
msgid "SQD extra, Linux x86_64, and serial native threads."
msgstr "需要 SQD extra、Linux x86_64 和串行原生线程。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:70
msgid ":doc:`tutorials/fragment-interaction`"
msgstr ":doc:`tutorials/fragment-interaction`"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:71
msgid "Core install for ``classical_only``. SQD extra and Linux x86_64 for ``full``."
msgstr "``classical_only`` 只需核心安装。``full`` 需要 SQD extra 和 Linux x86_64。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:72
msgid "H3O+ MC diagnostics"
msgstr "H3O+ MC 诊断"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:73
msgid "Catalyst and solvation extras. 16 GB+ RAM recommended."
msgstr "需要 catalyst 和 solvation extras。建议至少 16 GB 内存。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:74
msgid "8-bit QPE and dynamic-Trotter diagnostics"
msgstr "8 位 QPE 与动态 Trotter 诊断"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:75
msgid "30 GB+ RAM recommended. Use the scripts' memory guards."
msgstr "建议至少 30 GB 内存。使用脚本提供的内存限制。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:77
msgid ""
"The memory recommendations are not measured upper bounds. See :doc:`tutorials/index` for "
"diagnostic script paths. Catalyst compilation depends on estimation wires, Trotter depth, and "
"Hamiltonian term count."
msgstr "建议内存不是实测上限。诊断脚本路径见 :doc:`tutorials/index`。Catalyst 编译取决于估算线数、Trotter 深度和哈密顿量项数。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:82
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:87
msgid "Symptom"
msgstr "现象"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:88
msgid "Action"
msgstr "操作"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:89
msgid "Missing ``catalyst`` or ``jax``"
msgstr "缺少 ``catalyst`` 或 ``jax``"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:90
msgid "Install the ``catalyst`` and ``solvation`` extras."
msgstr "安装 ``catalyst`` 和 ``solvation`` extras。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:91
msgid "Missing ``ffsim`` or ``qiskit_addon_sqd``"
msgstr "缺少 ``ffsim`` 或 ``qiskit_addon_sqd``"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:92
msgid "Install the ``sqd`` extra."
msgstr "安装 ``sqd`` extra。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:93
msgid "SQD rejects the platform, threads, or memory request"
msgstr "SQD 拒绝平台、线程或内存请求"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:94
msgid "Check :doc:`user-guide/sqd`. ``allow_large`` cannot bypass domain or hard limits."
msgstr "检查 :doc:`user-guide/sqd`。``allow_large`` 无法绕过适用域或硬上限。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:95
msgid "Slow first MC run"
msgstr "首次 MC 运行缓慢"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:96
msgid "Allow compilation to finish. Later runs can reuse compatible IR."
msgstr "等待编译完成。后续运行可复用兼容的 IR。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:97
msgid "H3O+ run exceeds memory"
msgstr "H3O+ 运行超出内存"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:98
msgid "Start with H2. Reduce Trotter depth or use more memory."
msgstr "先运行 H2。降低 Trotter 深度或增加可用内存。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:99
msgid "GPU device is unavailable"
msgstr "GPU 设备不可用"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:100
msgid "Check ``q2m3.core.device_utils``. CPU options include ``lightning.qubit`` and ``default.qubit``."
msgstr "检查 ``q2m3.core.device_utils``。CPU 可选 ``lightning.qubit`` 或 ``default.qubit``。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:102
msgid "Large QPE–HF difference"
msgstr "QPE–HF 差值较大"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:103
msgid "Check estimation wires, ``base_time``, energy shift, and Trotter depth."
msgstr "检查估算线数、``base_time``、能量偏移和 Trotter 深度。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.rst:105
msgid "Read :doc:`user-guide/core-concepts` before interpreting energy differences as chemistry."
msgstr "从化学角度解释能量差前，先阅读 :doc:`user-guide/core-concepts`。"
